      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Selective coronary radiography was performed in 100 patients with chronic CHD. Three indices of total affection of the coronary arteries including that modified by the authors, were analyzed with regard to assessment of relationships between the main clinical characteristics and indicators of left ventricular functions. A higher sensitivity of Califf's index modified by the authors was noted."},
